BAR0 window constants follow Linux brcmfmac/pcie.c (ISC, Broadcom Corporation).
The GPIO pin register bits in PDApcieT8103Link.cpp follow Linux
drivers/pinctrl/pinctrl-apple-gpio.c (GPL-2.0-only, Copyright (C) The Asahi Linux
Contributors).

The controller, PHY and port bring-up in PDApcieT8103Link.cpp (PMGR power
enable, device-tree tunables, PHY fuses, PHY clock/reset, port and root-port
setup) and the ADT register indices are ported from m1n1 src/pcie.c, src/pmgr.c
and src/tunables.c. The port shutdown there follows m1n1 pcie_shutdown()
(src/pcie.c) and Linux apple_pcie_port_teardown()/apple_pcie_tunnel_stop()
(pcie-apple.c, GPL-2.0, as above). The SMC client in PDAppleSMC.cpp (ASC mailbox, RTKit
management handshake, SMC endpoint and key commands) is ported from m1n1
src/asc.c, src/rtkit.c, src/smc.c and proxyclient/m1n1/fw/smc.py,
fw/asc/mgmt.py, fw/asc/kdebug.py and hw/asc.py. These m1n1 files are under the
